WEBVTT

00:00:28.632 --> 00:00:30.816
(Risate)

00:00:30.816 --> 00:00:33.278
(Applausi)

00:00:37.106 --> 00:00:40.629
Abbiamo avuto quattro
Presidenti americani.

00:00:40.629 --> 00:00:41.910
Obama, ovviamente.

00:00:41.910 --> 00:00:44.412
Oh, agli europei piaceva un sacco.

00:00:44.412 --> 00:00:46.747
Era un multilateralista.

00:00:46.747 --> 00:00:48.033
Privilegiava la diplomazia.

00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:50.537
Voleva stringere amicizia con l'Iran.

00:00:50.537 --> 00:00:52.157
[Barack chiede la tua amicizia]

00:00:52.157 --> 00:00:54.325
(Risate)

00:00:57.641 --> 00:00:58.889
E poi,